  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the roles of Civil Society and Climate Change and JustPeace Communities in Fiji</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is to mitigate conflict arising from the impact of climate change in Fiji. Specific objectives:(i) Fijian communities are resilient to climate change-related conflict(ii) Fijian civil society is equipped to engage with climate change affected communities experiencing conflict(iii) Fijian national policy is inclusive of the views of civil society organisations and affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
